<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">Sakachep: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8) n</para>
  <para style="h">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc1">PETER Lekhamuthuon Inkhatna</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Pet</para>
  <para style="mt1">PETER</para>
  <para style="mt2">Renga Lekhamuthuon Inkhatna</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chongmaruoi</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Peter renga Lekhamuthuon Inkhatna</char> hi hitaka, “Pathien a mi thangngei” Khristienngei ai ti, Asia Te Saktieng pumpuia chekinchâia omngei ranga miziek ani. Hi lekhamuthuon hin ai khîn tak chu a porepu ngei'n an taksônna sika dûk mintuonga omngei mohôkna rang ani. Amiziekpu'n a porepu ngei Jisua Khrista Thurchi Sa roi minriet nôkin, a thina, ânthoinôkna, a juong nôkna ranga chongkhâmna sabeina pêkin ai mohôk ani. Hi rietna sikin an dûktongna ngei khom pomin an tuongdier rang ani, mahah an taksônna a dettie minsinna ania, “Jisua Khrista a juong inlâr tika” chu râisânman ipêk nîng an tih, tiin a rilminthâr pe ngei ani. (1:7)</para>
  <para style="ip">Intakna zora a mohôkna le inruolin, a miziekpu'n a porepu ngei hah Khrista mingei anga om rangin a ngên sa ani.</para>
  <para style="is1">Asûnga chongtângpuingei</para>
  <para style="io1">Chogmaruoi <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pathien sanminringna min riet nôkna <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Inthienga ring ranga mohôkna <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:13-2:10">1:13—2:10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dûktuong zora Khristienngei sinpêl <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 2:11-4:19">2:11—4:19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khristien nunnêmna le chuonsin <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Chongkhârna <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 5:12-14">5:12-14</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1"/>Peter, Jisua Khrista tîrton renga, Pathien ithang, Pontus ram, Galatia ram, Cappadocia ram, Asia ram le Bithynia ram murdia chekinchâia om ngei. <verse eid="1PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2"/>Pa Pathien mintuo dungjûiin nangni ngei hah thang nin nia, male Jisua Khrista chong jôm rang le a thisena minthiengin a Ratha'n mi inthiengin nangni sin ani zoi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Nin chunga moroina le inngêina asipmatin om rese.<verse eid="1PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sabeina ring</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3"/>Ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista Pathien le pa chu minpâkin om rese. Ama han a moroina lien sikin thina renga Jisua Khrista kaithoiin ringna thar mi pêka, sabeina ring leh mi minsip zoi. <verse eid="1PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4"/>Masikin Pathien'n a mingei ranga rochon satvurna ngei ai dar hah chang rangin ei mântieng ei thîr ani. Ha ngei hah ama'n asiet thei khâiloi, achuoi thei khâiloi le ânmang thei khâloina invâna Pathien'n nin rangin a dar ani. <verse eid="1PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5"/>Sanminringna zora nûktaka inlang ranga a darchiena om hah man rangin taksônna sika Pathien sinthotheinân dar nin ni.<verse eid="1PE 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6"/>Masikin râiminsân roi, atûna hin dûk tamtak nin tuong sikin inngûiin la om khom ungla. <verse eid="1PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7"/>Nin taksônna adik mo itia nangni minthâr hah an khîn tak ani. Asiet thei rângkachak luo mana meia an minthâr ngâia, nin taksônna rângkachak nêka lut uol ok vang chu asôi theina rangin minsinin ai om rang ani. Hanchu Jisua Khrista ânlâr nikhuo han minpâkna, roiinpuina le chôiminsângna man nin tih. <verse eid="1PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8"/>Ama hah la mu tet ngâi no khom ungla nin lungkhama, atûn la mu no khom ungla nin iema, masikin râisâna misîr zoiloi roiinpui takin nin sip ngâi ani, <verse eid="1PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9"/>asikchu nin ratha ngei sannminringna nin mana, mahah ama nin taksônna abitak chu ani.<verse eid="1PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10"/>Ma sanminringna hah dêipungeiin asadimin an roka an phuola, ma neinunpêk Pathien'n nangni ai pêk rang hah an lei phuong sai ani. <verse eid="1PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11"/>Anni han kho zora mo ai tung rang le i-angin mo ai tung rang iti an zong ngâia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kho zora mo ai tung rang le i-angin mo ai tung rang; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mahah tumo ani rang le tikamo a juong rang.</char></note> An sûnga Khrista Ratha a om han, Khrista tuong rang tie le roiinpuia a om rang hah chongphuongna an lei dôn ngâi ani. <verse eid="1PE 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12"/>Ma dêipungei kôma han Pathien'n, an sin hah anni inlâpna rang ni loiin, nangni ranga an isin ani iti a min riet zoi. Ha chong hah Ratha Inthieng sinthotheina invân renga thangthei juongtîr, atûna nin iriet Thurchi Sa nangni misîr pe ngei hih an ni. Ma neinunngei hah vântîrtonngei luo khomin riet an nuom ngâi ani.<verse eid="1PE 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inthienga om ranga koina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13"/>Masikin nin mindonna hah sintho ranga inthoksaiin inningchienin om roi. Khrista a juong inlâr tika satvurna nangni pêk rang hah sabei phar roi. <verse eid="1PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14"/>Pathien chong jôm ungla, male ite rietloia nin om lâia nin ôina ngei han nin ringnunngei ajêk rangin inphal no roi. <verse eid="1PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15"/>Manêkin, nangni koipu Pathien ânthieng ang han nin thona murdia inthieng roi. <verse eid="1PE 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16"/>Pathien lekhabu'n, “Keima kên thieng sikin inthieng roi,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:44">Och 11:44</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 11:45">45</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:2">19:2</ref></char></note> ai ti ang han.<verse eid="1PE 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17"/>Hanchu mi murdi an sintho dungjûia ân-angnata roijêk ngâipu Pathien kôm chubai nin thôn, O Pa, nin ti ngâiin chu rammuola nin lêng kâr chu ama rangin mân inthieng thôn om roi. <verse eid="1PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18"/>Nin richibulngeiin nangni an pêk, nin nunchan mangmunboi renga hah, neinun asiet thei sumdâr le rângkachaka minjôk ni mak chei ti nin rieta; <verse eid="1PE 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19"/>belrite demnaboi aninônchu achâina boitêt anga, Khrista inbôlna manlutaka ratan nin nih. <verse eid="1PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20"/>Ama hah rammuol insieng mân renga Pathien'n a lei thangsai, le hi sûn nûktak ngeia hin nangni sikin inlangin ai om ani. <verse eid="1PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21"/>Ama sikin thina renga a kaithoipu le roiinpuina pêkpu Pathien hah nin iema; maleh masikin nin taksônna le nin sabeina ngei hah Pathien chunga mindetin ai om ani.<verse eid="1PE 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22"/>Atûn chu chongtak nin jômna sikin nin champui iempungei lungkham tatak rangin nangni nanâkin nin inthieng zoi sikin nin mulungrîl murdi'n inkhat le inkhat inlungkham inlôm roi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:22: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nin mulungrîl murdi'n; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mulung inthieng leh.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23"/>Athithei ni loiin, athitheiloi nulepa renga nâingei anghan, Pathien chong ring kumtuong chongbâi renga suok nôk nin nih. <verse eid="1PE 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24"/>Pathien lekhabu'n:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24,25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Isa 40:6-8</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">“Miriem murdi hih sûl angin an nia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">an roiinpuina ngei khom rama pârngei angin an ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Sûlngei chu athêma, male a pârngei atâka,<verse eid="1PE 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25"/>aniatachu, Pumapa chong chu tuonsôtin aom tit ani,” ai ti anghan. Hi chong hih, Thurchi Sa nin kôma an phuong hah ani.<verse eid="1PE 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2"/>
  <para style="s">Lung aring le nam inthieng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1"/>Hanchu, nangni nanâkin asaloi murdi ngei renga inkêm ungla; milak aninônchu asarothol aninônchu narsana aninônchu inêrona chongngei om khâi no nih. <verse eid="1PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2"/>Nâite asuok thar ngei angin ratha tienga nenetui ânthieng liei hah inrâl tit ungla, ha nenetui hah nin nêka anin chu insôn nin ta, sanminjôkin om nin tih. <verse eid="1PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3"/>Pathien lekhabu'n, “Pumapa satie hah ninthenin nin riet zoi”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:8">Lap 34:8</ref></char></note> a ti anghan.<verse eid="1PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4"/>Pumapa kôm hong roi, lung aring mingeiin mangmunboia an heng, nikhomrese, Pathien'n manlutak angin a ithang ngei. <verse eid="1PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5"/>Lung aring anghan hong ungla, rathatienga Pathien in sinna mangin om ungla, Jisua Khrista jâra Pathien pom theiruo ratha tienga inbôlna ipêk ranga ochai inthieng nin ni theina rangin. <verse eid="1PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6"/>Asikchu, Pathien lekhabu'n,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28:16</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">“Lung luttak ka thanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">Zionah akila lungin ka dar ani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">male tukhom ama iem kai chu mâimôkinshakin om tet ni no nih ngei,” a ti.<verse eid="1PE 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7"/>Nangni a iem ngei rangin chu manlut tak ani; nikhomrese, a iemloi ngei rangin chu:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Lap 118:22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">“In sinpungeiin lung mangmunboia an hengpai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">An kâra kamomtak achang zoi.”<verse eid="1PE 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8"/>Male Pathien lekhabu danga, ati:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14-15">Isa 8:14-15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">“Ma lungpui hah mingei minpalna rang le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">Mi inletna rang ani,” ai ti anghan.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Chong hah an iemloi sikin an inpal ani, mahah Pathien'n anni ranga a nuomna piel ani.<verse eid="1PE 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9"/>Ania nangni chu Pathien nam ithang, Rêng ochaingei, nam inthieng, Pathien a mingei, ajîngna renga avâr roiinpuitaka nangni koisuokpu Pathien sintho kamâmruoingei phuong ranga nangni thangsuok ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Jôk 19:5</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 19:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:20">Isa 43:20</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 43:21">21</ref> (LXX); <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Bal 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa 9:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10"/>Zora voikhat chu Pathien mingei nimak cheia, aniatachu atûn chu ama mingei nin ni zoi; Motona han chu Pathien moroina lei riet mak cheia, ania atûn chu a moroina nin chang zoi. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pathien suokngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11"/>Ka malngei, hi rammuola hin khuolmi le mi invâingei angin nangni ki ngên ani! Ratha leh râl indoi tit ngâi, taksa ôina ngei mâk rangin. <verse eid="1PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12"/>Sonongngei lâia nin nunchan sa ok rese; hanchu saloi tho ngei tiin nangni an nôn khomin nin sin asa an riet sika han ama juong Nikhuo han Pathien minpâk thei an tih.<verse eid="1PE 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13"/>Pumapa jâra han miriem rachamneipungei murdi kôma inpêklût roi, rachamneina insângtak dônpu Rêng le, <verse eid="1PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14"/>râiôtngei, asaloi sin ngei dûk min tuong rang le asa sin ngei minpâk ranga ai phun ngei kôma khom. <verse eid="1PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15"/>Nin neinun sa tho ngei sika han amo ngei chong inmôl min dâirek rang hi Pathien nangni a nuomna ani sikin. <verse eid="1PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16"/>Zalên mi anghan lêng ungla; nikhomrese nin zalêna hah saloi mukhunân mang loiin, Pathien suokngei anghan om roi. <verse eid="1PE 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17"/>Mitin mirit ungla, nin iempu champuingei lungkham ungla, Pathien jâ ungla, Rêng mirit pêk roi.<verse eid="1PE 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista tuongna minenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18"/>Nangni suokngei, nin pungei kôma inpêklût ungla akippharin jâna pêk roi, mi asingngei le nunhoi ngei kôma vai ni loiin mi nunminsie ngei kôm khom. <verse eid="1PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19"/>A lungdo ani iti rietin ana tuongloiruo nin tuongin chu Pathien'n sat nangni vur a tih. <verse eid="1PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20"/>Nin tho minchâi sika jêmna nin tuongin, imo nin man ranga? Aniatachu, adik nin tho sika nin tuong chu, Pathien'n sat nangni vur a tih. <verse eid="1PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21"/>Ha anga ranga Pathien'n nangni ai koi kêng; Khrista khom han nin ta rangin a lei tuonga, a kenûk nin jûi theina ranga minenna rang nangni a mâk pe ani. <verse eid="1PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22"/>Ama hah nunsie reng sin ngâi maka, a bâi renga milak chong asuok reng tutên riet ngâi mak ngei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Isa 53:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23"/>An êro lâiin ama'n chu thuon maka, dûk a tuong lâiin ama'n chu min tuongna rangin misina chong ti ngâi mak, aniatachu roijêkpu diktak Pathien kôm a sabeina ngei a dar ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa 53:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24"/>Nunsiena tieng ei thia dikna tieng ei ring theina rangin Khrista lelên a taksân khrosa ei sietnangei ai pêl ani. Ama sabê ngei sikin mindam nin ni zoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Isa 53:5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 53:6">6</ref> (LXX) </char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25"/>Nangni hih belri lam ânvâi angin nin lei ni, aniatachu atûn chu nin ratha ngei Hôlpu le Enkolpu jûi ranga hong tuong nôk nin ni zoi.<verse eid="1PE 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3"/>
  <para style="s">Lômnungei le lômpangei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1"/>Ma angdên han nangni lômnu ngei, nin lômpa ngei kôma nin inpêklût ngêt rang ani, hanke an lâia mi Pathien chong iemloi an om le khoma nin nunchan han mene ngei a ta, iem an tih. Chongin nin ti rang nâng no nih,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Eph 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:18">Kol 3:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2"/>nin nunchan inthieng le mirit hah an mu rang sikin. <verse eid="1PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3"/>Nin invona hah pêntienga nin mêlsana rangin nin invona sam mini, aninônchu rângkachak invona ngei mini, aninônchu silbomngei mini nin mang rang nimak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:9">1 Tim 2:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4"/>Manêkin, nin mulungrîla mêlsana hah, nin mulungrîla ratha dâiriem le nunnêmna invona dik tar ngâiloi nirese, mahah Pathien mitmua chu alut tak ani. <verse eid="1PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5"/>Zora lei vunsaia nupangngei, Pathien kôma inpêka ama chunga an sabeina bâng ngâi ngei han an lômpa ngei kôma enhoitakin an inpêklût ngâi ani. <verse eid="1PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6"/>Sarah hah ma anghan ania, Abraham chong a jôma, ka puma, tiin a koi ngâi ani. Atûn khom asa nin sina, ite china reng nin dônin chu Sarah nâinupangngei nin ni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Aph 18:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7"/>Ma angdên han nangni lômpangei khom, nin lômnungei hah nangni ranga râtloi uol anni iti riettheiin nin lêngpui ngei rang ani. Jana dôn pumin ompui ngei ungla, asikchu anni khom nangni leh munkhatin Pathien manboipêk ringna hah an man sa rang ani. Nin chubai tho ânkalpui loina rangin mahah tho roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Eph 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:19">Kol 3:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adik sin sika tuongna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8"/>Chongkhârna rangin: mulung munkhatin om ngêt ungla, lâibungngei le sarnungei anghan inkhat le inkhat inlungkham ungla, inkhat le inkhat inuoina dônin inlungkham inlômin om roi. <verse eid="1PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9"/>Saloi hah saloiin thuon no ungla, khomâksâm hah khomâksâmin thuon no roi; manêkin satvurnân thuon roi, asikchu Pathien'n nangni a koi lâia han sat nangni vur rangin kêng ânkhâm. <verse eid="1PE 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10"/>Pathien lekhabu'n;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Lap 34:12-16</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“Tukhom ahoitaka ringna mang anuom le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">zora sa ngei mu a nuomin chu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">chongsie ril mâkin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">milak tho mong rese.<verse eid="1PE 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11"/>Sietna renga inheiin asa an sin ngêt rang ani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">Inngêina rangin an mulungrîl murdi'n an putrît ngêt rang ani.<verse eid="1PE 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12"/>Asikchu Pumapa'n midik ngei chu a ensuia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">male an chubaithona khom a rangâi pe ngei ngâi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">Aniatachu, saloi sin ngei chu adoi ngâi,” ai ti anghan.<verse eid="1PE 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13"/>Asa sin rang nin jôta anin chu tumo dûk nangni tho ranga? <verse eid="1PE 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14"/>Hannirese asa nin sin sikin chu tuong ta ngân khom ungla, satvur nin ni. Tute chi no ungla, nin kângmindoi no roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:10">Mat 5:10</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14,15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:10">Mat 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:12-13">Isa 8:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15"/>Aniatachu, Khrista hah nin mulungrîla mân inthiengin Pumapa mirit tho roi. Male tukhomin nin sabeina chungroia chong nangni an rekelin zoratin thuon rangin inthok titin om roi, <verse eid="1PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16"/>nikhomrese, innêmtak le miritin thuon roi. Asielesarietna inthâr nei ungla, hanchu nangni an êrona tienga han, Khrista nûkjûi ngei nin nina nin nunchan asa rilsiet ngei hah an chong ti han inzak an tih. <verse eid="1PE 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17"/>Saloi sin sika tuong nêkin chu Pathien nuomlam anîn chu asa sin sika tuong chu asa uol. <verse eid="1PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18"/>Asikchu Pathien kôm nangni a tuong theina rangin Khrista midik han nunsiengei murdi ruthûlin minunsie ngei sikin voikhatin ai thi ani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">athi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngeia chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">atuong.</char></note> Taksatieng thatin a oma, hannirese rathatieng chu minringin a oma, <verse eid="1PE 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19"/>ma ratha hong om sika han intâng ina ratha omngei kôm khom chong a juong misîr ani. <verse eid="1PE 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20"/>Ma ratha ngei hah Noah nikhuoa rukuong a sin lâia Pathien'n tuongdiertaka a ngâk sûnga chongjôm nuomloi hah an ni. Ma rukuonga han mi tômte, anrêngin mi iriet vai tui renga minringin an om ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7:24">Aph 6:1—7:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21"/>Maha chu baptisma akhîn minenna ania, atûna hin Jisua Khrista inthoinôkna sikin nangni a minring ani. Ma hah takpuma ânnim minsâina ni maka, asaleasierietna diktak Pathien kôma chongkhâm hah ani. <verse eid="1PE 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22"/>Jisua Khrista hah invâna a sea, Pathien changtienga insungin vântîrtonngei, rachamneinangei le sinthotheinangei, ama racham takin a jêk zoi ani.<verse eid="1PE 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ringna inthûl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1"/>Khrista'n taksân a tuong zoi sikin nangni khom ha anghan minrâtin nin mulungrîla mindon ngêt sa roi; asikchu tukhom taksân a tuong zoiin chu nunsie an inchel khâiloi ani. <verse eid="1PE 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2"/>Hanchu, atûn renga chu nin rammuol ringnunngei a la om kai chu miriem ôinangeiin om khâi loiin Pathien lungdôa jêkin nin om ngêt rang ani zoi. <verse eid="1PE 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3"/>Zora leivuna han sonongngeiin an tho nuom ngâi ngei hah asôtzan nin lei manga. Nin ringnunngei hah hurna ngei, taksa ôina ngei, junrûina ngei, jumun hoiinhâinangei, junêk ruolhoi ngei le mirmil biekna porinche ngeiin nin mang ok ngâi zoi. <verse eid="1PE 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4"/>Male atûn chu sonongngei hah porinche le ringnun saloi an mangna han nin kop khâiloi sikin nangni an kamâma, masikin nangni an êro ngâi ani. <verse eid="1PE 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5"/>Hannirese ha ngei han, Pathien, aring le athi roijêk ranga ânthoksaipu kôma han an thurchi chit la misîr an tih. <verse eid="1PE 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6"/>Masika han kêng ithi ngei lâia khom Thurchi Sa misîr ani, mitin taksa roijêka an hong om anghan an ratha ringna roijêka om ngei kôma han; an ratha ringna han Pathien anga an om theina rangin an kôma chong misîr ani.<verse eid="1PE 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pathien manboipêkngei enkolpu sa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7"/>Neinun murdi mongna anâi zoi, masikin chubai nin tho theina rangin indîntheiin intûng roi. <verse eid="1PE 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8"/>Neinuntin chunga, mulungrîl takin inkhat le inkhat inlungkham roi, lungkhamnân nunsiena tamtak a mukhu thei sikin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Chvr 10:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9"/>Chier loiin nin in inmo-ong inlôm chit roi. <verse eid="1PE 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10"/>Mi tinin Pathien manboipêkngei adadangngei enkolpu sa anghan, Pathien renga manboipêk alieka ai man ngei hah midang ngei satna rangin a mang ngêt rang ani. <verse eid="1PE 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11"/>Tukhomin thurchi a misîrin chu, Pathien chongbe a misîr ngêt rang ani; Tukhomin mi sin a thôn chu Pathien'n râtna a pêk anghan a tho ngêt rang ani. Jisua Khrista jâra neinunngei murdi Pathien minpâka a om theina rangin, roiinpuina le sinthotheina chu tuonsôt tuonsôtin ama ta ani sikin. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khristien sika tuongna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12"/>Ka mal moroitak ngei, minsinna natak nin tuonga atung ngâi loi nin chunga atung hih nin jâmminzal no roi. <verse eid="1PE 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13"/>Khrista roiinpuina a juong inlang tika râisâna nin sip theina ranga Khrista tuongna ngei nin tuongpui ai ni anghan râiminsân roi. <verse eid="1PE 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14"/>Khrista nûkjûipu ngei nin ni sika êroa nin omin chu satvur nin ni; Ratha roiinpui, Pathien Ratha hah nin chunga a om sikin. <verse eid="1PE 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15"/>Nin lâia tumakhatin nin tuongin chu, mi that sika mini, inru tho sika mini, neinun tho minchâi sika mini, midang ngei chungroi jêk pe sika mini chu ni tet no rese. <verse eid="1PE 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16"/>Nikhomresea, Khristien nin ni sika nin tuong chu inzak no ungla, Khrista riming nin pêl ai ni anghan Pathien kôm râisânchong ril roi.<verse eid="1PE 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17"/>Roijêkna phut rang zora ahong tung zoi, Pathien ama mingei jêk masa nîng an tih. Mahah einia phut aninte, Pathien renga Thurchi Sa iemloi ngei kôma han kho-ang takin mo ai mong rang ani zoi. <verse eid="1PE 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18"/>Pathien lekhabu'n;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Chvr 11:31</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">“Mi sa ngei sanminring an ni rang luo antakin chu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">pathienboi mi nunsie ngei hah imo an chang rang ani zoi?” ai ti anghan.<verse eid="1PE 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19"/>Masikin Pathien lungdoa an nia, an tuongin chu sin asa thôn a Sinpu ânkhâmna tho ngâipu kôma inbâng phar rese ngei.<verse eid="1PE 4:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5"/>
  <para style="s">Pathien belripâlngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1"/>Keima, nin lâia koiindang upangei hah, keima an upa champui, Khrista tuongna rietpuipu, roiinpuina juong inlang ranga rangtum man rangpu hin nangni ki ngên ani. <verse eid="1PE 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2"/>Pathien'n nangni ai pêk belri pâl donsûi rang le jôtloiin ni loiin, Pathien nuomlama jôttaka donsûi rangin. Lo ririem sik ni loiin sintho ranga nuomna tak dônin nin sintum hah tho roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:15-17">Joh 21:15-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3"/>Nin donsûingei chunga inlal rangin pût no ungla, hannirese belripâlngei enton rang chang roi. <verse eid="1PE 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4"/>Male Belrihôlpu Inlaltak hah a juong inlâr tika chu Rênglukhum roiinpuitak, avârna inmang ngâiloi hah man nin tih.<verse eid="1PE 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5"/>Ma angdên han, nangni nâipanguol ngei, ulienngei kôma inpêklût roi. Sin nin inthope inlôm theina rangin, nunnêmnân invo roi; Pathien lekhabu'n, “Pathien'n mi ânpâkngei chu adoia, aniatachu mi nunnêm ngei chu a midit ngâi,” ai ti anghan. <verse eid="1PE 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6"/>Masikin azora taka nangni a chôiminsâng theina rangin Pathien kut râttak nuoia han nuninnêm takin om roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7"/>Nangni a donsûi ngâi sikin nin kângdoinangei murdi ama chunga bâng riei roi.<verse eid="1PE 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8"/>Intûng chienin en chak roi! Nin râlpa Diabol hah ikeibaknei ânrâm anghan a sâk rang rokin a chaititîr ngâi kêng. <verse eid="1PE 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9"/>Rammuol pumpuia nin iempu champui ngei khomin ma angdên han an tuong sa iti nin riet sikin nin taksônna mindet titin ama hah doi roi. <verse eid="1PE 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10"/>Hannirese chomolte nin tuong suole chu, moroina murdi Pathien, Khrista leh inzoma a kumtuong roiinpuina chang ranga nangni koipu lele han nangni sinmikhippin detna, râtna le lungphûm adet nangni pêng a tih. <verse eid="1PE 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11"/>Ama kôma han sinthotheina chu tuonsôtin om rese! Amen.<verse eid="1PE 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Azoina chibaimûknangei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12"/>Hi lekhamuthuon abongte hih Khristien champui taksônom Silas, sanna jâra ki miziek ani. Nangni mohôka, ma hih Pathien moroina diktak ani iti ko chungroi nangni min riet ka nuom ani. Mahin inding dettit roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:22">Sin 15:22</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 15:40">40</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13"/>Babylona,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">babylon: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Chongphuong bua ânziek angin Rome tina anithei.</char></note> om nin sarnu Pathien'n ai thang koiindang le ka nâipasal Mark<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Sin 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Philm 24</ref></char></note> khomin chibai nangni an mûk sa. <verse eid="1PE 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14"/>Khristien lungkhamna intum inthiengin chibai inmûk inlôm ngâi roi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Nin lâia Khrista ta ngei murdi kôm han inngêina om rese.<verse eid="1PE 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5"/>
</usx>
